                                "text": "\"Oh, if I could have been there!\" muttered Kirby. \"But it wouldn't have done.\" \"At the last, Howaji,\" finished Najib, \"he was what box fighters call 'downward and outward.' I dragged him to the camp's edge and left him to becrawl himself away."
